  "body": "This release fixes another macOS issue where dead keys, for example the two-key sequence `\",space` on the US International keyboard layout would incorrectly insert space ([#12979](https://github.com/fish-shell/fish-shell/issues/12979)).\n\n---\n\nA GPG signature for `fish-4.9.3.tar.xz` using [this key](https://github.com/krobelus.gpg) is available as `fish-4.9.3.tar.xz.asc`.\n\nThe files called `fish-4.9.3-linux-*.tar.xz` contain [standalone fish binaries](https://github.com/fish-shell/fish-shell/?tab=readme-ov-file#building-fish-with-cargo) for any Linux with the given CPU architecture.\n",
